    "badge": "CGL 2024",
    "question": {
      "en": "If $a+b+c = 6$ and $a^2+b^2+c^2 = 14$, find $ab+bc+ca$.",
      "hi": "यदि $a+b+c = 6$ और $a^2+b^2+c^2 = 14$ है, तो $ab+bc+ca$ ज्ञात कीजिए।"
    },
    "options": "(a) 11 &emsp; (b) 12 &emsp; (c) 10 &emsp; (d) 13",
    "solution": {
      "en": "$(a+b+c)^2 = a^2+b^2+c^2 + 2(ab+bc+ca)$<br>$36 = 14 + 2(ab+bc+ca) \\implies 2(ab+bc+ca) = 22 \\implies ab+bc+ca = \\mathbf{11}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) 11</strong>",
      "hi": "$(a+b+c)^2 = a^2+b^2+c^2 + 2(ab+bc+ca)$<br>$36 = 14 + 2(ab+bc+ca) \\implies ab+bc+ca = \\mathbf{11}$ है।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) 11</strong>"
    }
  },
