  {
    "id": "ALG4",
    "badge": "CGL 2023",
    "question": {
      "en": "If $a - \\frac{1}{a} = 4$, find $a^4 + \\frac{1}{a^4}$.",
      "hi": "यदि $a - \\frac{1}{a} = 4$ है, तो $a^4 + \\frac{1}{a^4}$ ज्ञात कीजिए।"
    },
    "options": "(a) 322 &emsp; (b) 324 &emsp; (c) 320 &emsp; (d) 318",
    "solution": {
      "en": "1. $\\left(a - \\frac{1}{a}\\right)^2 = a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2} - 2 \\implies 16 = a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2} - 2 \\implies a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2} = 18$.<br>2. $\\left(a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2}\\right)^2 = a^4 + \\frac{1}{a^4} + 2 \\implies 324 = a^4 + \\frac{1}{a^4} + 2 \\implies a^4 + \\frac{1}{a^4} = \\mathbf{322}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) 322</strong>",
      "hi": "1. $a^2 + \\frac{1}{a^2} = 18$।<br>2. $a^4 + \\frac{1}{a^4} = 18^2 - 2 = \\mathbf{322}$ है।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) 322</strong>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ALG5",
    "badge": "CGL 2022",
    "question": {
      "en": "If $x+y = 7$ and $xy = 12$, find $x^3+y^3$.",
      "hi": "यदि $x+y = 7$ और $xy = 12$ है, तो $x^3+y^3$ ज्ञात कीजिए।"
    },
    "options": "(a) 91 &emsp; (b) 133 &emsp; (c) 85 &emsp; (d) 95",
    "solution": {
      "en": "$x^3+y^3 = (x+y)^3 - 3xy(x+y) = 7^3 - 3(12)(7) = 343 - 252 = \\mathbf{91}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) 91</strong>",
      "hi": "$x^3+y^3 = (x+y)^3 - 3xy(x+y) = 343 - 252 = \\mathbf{91}$ है।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) 91</strong>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ALG6",
    "badge": "CGL 2022",
    "question": {
      "en": "If $a^2+b^2+c^2 - ab-bc-ca = 0$, then find $a : b : c$.",
      "hi": "यदि $a^2+b^2+c^2 - ab-bc-ca = 0$ है, तो $a : b : c$ ज्ञात कीजिए।"
    },
    "options": "(a) 1 : 1 : 1 &emsp; (b) 1 : 2 : 3 &emsp; (c) 1 : 1 : 2 &emsp; (d) 2 : 1 : 1",
    "solution": {
      "en": "The identity can be written as: $\\frac{1}{2}[(a-b)^2 + (b-c)^2 + (c-a)^2] = 0$.<br>Since squares cannot be negative, each term must be zero: $a=b=c \\implies a : b : c = \\mathbf{1 : 1 : 1}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) 1 : 1 : 1</strong>",
      "hi": "सर्वसमिका को इस प्रकार लिखा जा सकता है: $\\frac{1}{2}[(a-b)^2 + (b-c)^2 + (c-a)^2] = 0$।<br>अतः $a=b=c \\implies a : b : c = \\mathbf{1 : 1 : 1}$ है।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) 1 : 1 : 1</strong>"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ALG7",
    "badge": "CGL 2021",
    "question": {
      "en": "If $a^3+b^3+c^3 = 3abc$, then find value of $\\frac{(a+b+c)^2}{a^2+b^2+c^2}$.",
      "hi": "यदि $a^3+b^3+c^3 = 3abc$ है, तो $\\frac{(a+b+c)^2}{a^2+b^2+c^2}$ का मान ज्ञात कीजिए।"
    },
    "options": "(a) 3 &emsp; (b) 1 &emsp; (c) 9 &emsp; (d) 2",
    "solution": {
      "en": "If $a^3+b^3+c^3 = 3abc$, then $a+b+c=0$ or $a=b=c$.<br>If $a=b=c$, then expression becomes: $\\frac{(3a)^2}{3a^2} = \\frac{9a^2}{3a^2} = \\mathbf{3}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) 3</strong>",
      "hi": "यदि $a^3+b^3+c^3 = 3abc$ है, तो $a+b+c=0$ या $a=b=c$ होगा।<br>यदि $a=b=c$ हो, तो मान $\\mathbf{3}$ प्राप्त होता है।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) 3</strong>"
    }
  },
