    "badge": "CGL 2020",
    "question": {
      "en": "If $x = 2 + \\sqrt{3}$, find the value of $x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2}$.",
      "hi": "यदि $x = 2 + \\sqrt{3}$ है, तो $x^2 + \\frac{1}{x^2}$ का मान ज्ञात कीजिए।"
    },
    "options": "(a) 14 &emsp; (b) 12 &emsp; (c) 16 &emsp; (d) 10",
    "solution": {
      "en": "Since $x = 2+\\sqrt{3} \\implies \\frac{1}{x} = 2-\\sqrt{3}$.<br>So $x+\\frac{1}{x} = 4$.<br>Therefore, $x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2} = \\left(x+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^2 - 2 = 16 - 2 = \\mathbf{14}$.<br><br><strong>Answer: (a) 14</strong>",
      "hi": "चूंकि $x = 2+\\sqrt{3} \\implies \\frac{1}{x} = 2-\\sqrt{3}$ है।<br>अतः $x+\\frac{1}{x} = 4$।<br>इसलिए, $x^2+\\frac{1}{x^2} = 16 - 2 = \\mathbf{14}$ होगा।<br><br><strong>उत्तर: (a) 14</strong>"
    }
  },
