    "options": "(a) 1 &emsp; (b) 3 &emsp; (c) 0 &emsp; (d) 1/3",
    "solution": {
      "en": "Let $x=a-b, y=b-c, z=c-a$. Note that $x+y+z=0$.<br>If sum is zero, then $x^3+y^3+z^3 = 3xyz$.<br>The expression is $\\frac{3xyz}{3xyz} = \\mathbf{1}$.<br><br><strong>Correct Answer: (a) 1</strong>",
      "hi": "मान लीजिए $x=a-b, y=b-c, z=c-a$। यहाँ $x+y+z=0$ है।<br>अतः $x^3+y^3+z^3 = 3xyz$ होगा।<br>व्यंजक का मान $\\frac{3xyz}{3xyz} = \\mathbf{1}$ है।<br><br><strong>सही उत्तर: (a) 1</strong>"
    }
